 "summary": "Nothing in TauCeti or Mathlib already provides a standard-chart trivialization of the twisting sheaves or an invertibility instance for them; the only twistingSheaf modules are Basic.lean and the new LocalTriviality.lean. The new code builds on the existing API: it gets the basis section from `const`, the degree-zero comparison from `sectionsLinearEquivTwistingSheafZero`, invertibility from `LocalTrivializations.ofIsOpenCover`, and the cover from `iSup_basicOpen_\u03b9_eq_top`, so it re-derives nothing a located declaration already provides.",
